# hardware-configuration.nix used to be gitignored ("generated per machine,
# never commit"), back when this repo held one machine at repo root - the
# risk was copy-pasting one machine's file onto another by accident. Now
# each host has its own hardware-configuration.nix in its own hosts/<name>/
# directory, so that risk is gone, and flakes need every file they touch to
# be git-tracked anyway (`nix eval`/`nixos-rebuild --flake` both fail on
# gitignored files). So: commit them, per host.
result
result-*

# adguardvpn-cli stores account credentials and session state here.
# Never commit it - this repo is public.
.local/
adguardvpn-cli/
